              "content": "Get all LDAP users of an authentication LDAP config with pagination supported. Users are mapped with qTest users won't be returned.\n\nIf <strong>pageSize</strong> and <strong>page</strong> is omitted, all users will be returned without any default paging data.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
